                  <section eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-53-30">
                    <num>53-30</num>
                    <heading>Territories Stolen Generations Redress Scheme payments are exempt</heading>
                    <content>
                      <p>Payments under the scheme known as the Territories Stolen Generations Redress Scheme are exempt from income tax.</p>
                      <p>3  Application of amendments</p>
                      <p>The amendments of the<i> Income Tax Assessment Act 1997 </i>made by this Part apply to assessments for the 2021-22 income year and later income years.</p>
                    </content>
